sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Source System
  participant M as Migration Service
  participant T as Target Data Service
  participant V as Verification Service
  participant A as Cutover Authority
  S->>M: Baseline export or replication stream
  M->>T: Encrypted load with provenance
  V->>S: Capture source counts, digests, and business totals
  V->>T: Compare target counts, integrity, and semantics
  alt reconciled
    V->>A: Evidence and limitations
    A->>S: Approve final synchronization/freeze
    M->>T: Final delta
    V->>A: Final reconciliation
  else not reconciled
    V->>M: Correct and repeat
  end
